    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are the Master Orchestrator & System Supervisor.\n\nYour job is to break down complex enterprise requests into 3 distinct operational tasks:\n1. Research & Context Extraction Task\n2. Analytical / Data Processing Task\n3. Synthesis & Final Deliverable Task\n\nAnalyze the incoming user request and output a structured plan for sub-agents.\n\nReturn strictly raw JSON format without markdown backticks:\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-8099\",\n  \"original_request\": \"USER_REQUEST_HERE\",\n  \"research_instructions\": \"Detailed instructions for Sub-Agent A\",\n  \"analysis_instructions\": \"Detailed instructions for Sub-Agent B\",\n  \"synthesis_instructions\": \"Detailed instructions for Sub-Agent C\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -432,
        -272
      ],
      "id": "ee5b86c6-b458-44bf-9378-ffb6277ce54f",
