    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the Principal Quality Assurance Auditor.\n\nEvaluate the aggregated payload from Sub-Agent A (Research), Sub-Agent B (Analytics), and Sub-Agent C (Synthesis).\n\nAggregated Payload:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nValidation Criteria:\n1. All 3 sub-agent sections (research_data, analytics_data, synthesis_data) must contain valid, non-empty data.\n2. The findings must directly address the original request logic.\n\nReturn strictly raw JSON format without markdown backticks:\n{\n  \"qa_passed\": true,\n  \"qa_score\": 92,\n  \"review_summary\": \"All three sub-agent deliverables meet enterprise quality standards.\",\n  \"rejection_reason\": null\n}",
        "options": {}
